{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54060","headline":"辞雪峰和尚（题拟） · 道允","name":"辞雪峰和尚（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂辞雪岭伴云行，谷口无关路坦平。\n禅师莫愁怀别恨，犹如秋月月常明。\n（《祖堂集》卷七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道允","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}